<title>JORDAN: Jordan dinar overnight rate rises to 9 pct.</title>
<headline>Jordan dinar overnight rate rises to 9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-01-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar rose to a high 9.01 percent on Saturday from 8.49 percent on Thursday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>The Central Bank said nine banks traded on the market in 24 reported transactions with a total value of 24.65 million dinars ($34.8 million).</p>
<p>$1 = 0.7080 dinar --Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
